  "description": "CR 614.1d, 614.12, 106.3: Kalain, Reclusive Painter makes a Treasure as it enters, and each other creature its controller casts enters with a +1/+1 counter for each mana from a Treasure spent to cast it",
  "note": "Kalain is cast with one Treasure's mana and gets no counter: CR 614.12 keeps an ability affecting a general subset of permanents from applying to its own entry. Hill Giant is cast with two Treasures' mana (a Buried Treasure and Kalain's Treasure token) and enters with two, the count of its own spend and not Kalain's one. Grizzly Bears cast off two Forests get none. On bob's turn his Bears, cast with a Treasure's green, get none: he does not control Kalain.",
